        video: Annotated[dict[str, Any], WithJsonSchema({'allOf': [{'if': {'required': ['fps_mode']}, 'then': {'required': ['fps']}}], 'description': '视频参数，必填', 'properties': {'bitrate_crf': {'default': 25, 'description': 'bitrate_crf 仅在 bitrate_mode=crf 时生效；值越小画质越高、体积越大，0 表示无损。bitrate_crf 范围 [0, 51]。', 'maximum': 51, 'minimum': 0, 'type': 'number', 'x-description-en': 'The CRF (Constant Rate Factor) parameter is the primary quality controller and is effective only when bitrate_mode is crf. Its value ranges from 0 to 51, with a default of 25. A smaller value produces higher quality and a larger file, and 0 means lossless. This parameter is optional.'}, 'bitrate_kbps': {'default': 2000, 'description': 'video.bitrate_kbps 在 crf、abr、cbr 模式下分别表示最大码率限制、平均码率目标、恒定码率目标。', 'maximum': 50000, 'minimum': 10, 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The target video bitrate, in Kbps, ranging from 10 to 50000 with a default of 2000. Its exact effect depends on the bitrate mode: in crf mode it is the maximum bitrate limit, in abr mode it is the average bitrate target, and in cbr mode it is the constant bitrate target.'}, 'bitrate_mode': {'default': 'crf', 'description': 'crf 推荐用于大多数场景，尽量保持 bitrate_crf 指定的视觉质量，并以 bitrate_kbps 限制瞬时码率。abr 调整码率使整体平均码率接近 bitrate_kbps，适合将文件大小控制在特定范围。cbr 尝试让视频流每秒严格保持 bitrate_kbps 设定码率，适合要求网络传输稳定的流媒体场景。', 'enum': ['crf', 'abr', 'cbr'], 'type': 'string', 'x-description-en': 'The bitrate control mode, which defaults to crf. In crf (Constant Rate Factor) mode, the system tries to keep the overall visual quality at your target level, where a smaller value yields higher quality, while ensuring the instantaneous bitrate does not exceed the bitrate limit. This mode offers the best balance between quality and file size and is recommended for most scenarios.'}, 'codec': {'default': 'h264', 'description': '视频编码格式支持 h264 和 h265，默认是 h264。', 'enum': ['h264', 'h265'], 'type': 'string', 'x-description-en': 'The video codec, which defaults to h264 and can be set to h264 or h265.'}, 'fps': {'description': 'fps 范围 [1, 240]；vfr 下是最大帧率，cfr 下是恒定帧率。', 'maximum': 240, 'minimum': 1, 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': "The target frame rate, with a supported value ranging from 1 to 240. Setting this parameter activates the fps_mode logic: in vfr mode it represents the maximum frame rate, while in cfr mode it represents the constant frame rate. If not set, the source's frame rate is used. This parameter is optional."}, 'fps_mode': {'default': 'vfr', 'description': '只有设置 fps 后 fps_mode 才生效；未提供 fps 时遵循原视频帧率并忽略 fps_mode。cfr 将 fps 作为强制恒定输出帧率。vfr 将 fps 作为最高帧率；源帧率较低时保留，较高时降低到 fps。', 'enum': ['vfr', 'cfr'], 'type': 'string', 'x-description-en': 'Controls the frame-rate mode for the transcoded video and is optional. It takes effect only after you set the fps parameter; if you do not provide fps, the source frame rate is used and this setting is ignored. The default is vfr, a variable frame-rate mode in which the fps value acts as the maximum frame-rate limit, so when the source frame rate is lower than your fps value the source rate is kept.'}, 'is_hdr_to_sdr': {'default': True, 'description': 'true 将 HDR 转换为 SDR；false 保留 HDR。', 'type': 'boolean', 'x-description-en': 'Optional. Whether to convert HDR (High Dynamic Range) video to SDR (Standard Dynamic Range) video. Defaults to `true`; set to `false` to keep HDR.'}, 'scale_height': {'description': 'scale_height 单位为 px，范围 [0, 4320]，仅在 scale_type=2 时生效；只传宽或高之一时另一边按比例缩放。', 'maximum': 4320, 'minimum': 0, 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The target height, in px. The value range is [0, 4320]. Effective only when scale_type is 2 (width/height limit mode). If only one of scale_width or scale_height is provided, the other side scales proportionally. This parameter is optional.'}, 'scale_long': {'description': 'scale_long 单位为 px，范围 [0, 4320]，仅在 scale_type=1 时生效；只传短边或长边之一时另一边按比例缩放。', 'maximum': 4320, 'minimum': 0, 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The target long side, in px. The value range is [0, 4320]. Effective only when scale_type is 1 (long/short-side limit mode). If only one of scale_short or scale_long is provided, the other side scales proportionally. This parameter is optional.'}, 'scale_mode': {'default': 0, 'description': 'scale_mode 仅在 scale_type 为 1 或 2 时生效。0 不上采：源片大于目标时缩小，小于目标时保持原尺寸。1 强制拉伸到目标宽高，可能导致画面变形。2 等比缩放到目标框内并用黑边填充不足部分。', 'enum': [0, 1, 2], 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The fill and stretch strategy. It takes effect only when scale_type is 1 or 2, and is used to handle mismatches between your target dimensions and the source aspect ratio. Set it to 0 for no upsampling, where the video is shrunk if the source is larger than the target and the original size is kept if it is smaller, or to 1 for stretch upsampling, which force-stretches to the target width and height. Defaults to 0. This parameter is optional.'}, 'scale_short': {'description': 'scale_short 单位为 px，范围 [0, 4320]，仅在 scale_type=1 时生效；只传短边或长边之一时另一边按比例缩放。', 'maximum': 4320, 'minimum': 0, 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The target length of the short side of the video, in px, with a value range of [0, 4320]. It takes effect only when scale_type is set to 1 (long/short-side limit mode). If only one of scale_short or scale_long is provided, the other side scales proportionally. This field is optional.'}, 'scale_type': {'default': 0, 'description': 'scale_type=0 跟随片源且不缩放，相关尺寸参数无效，最高支持 8K。scale_type=1 激活 scale_short 和 scale_long，另一边按原比例缩放，最高支持 4K。scale_type=2 激活 scale_width 和 scale_height，另一边按原比例缩放，最高支持 4K。视频缩放模式默认是 0。', 'enum': [0, 1, 2], 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The video scaling mode, which defaults to 0. It can be set to 0 for follow-source mode, where no scaling is performed and scale_mode, scale_width, scale_height, scale_short, and scale_long are all ignored; this mode supports up to 8K resolution. It can be set to 1 for long/short-side limit mode, which activates scale_short and scale_long so you can set the long or short side of the output while the other side scales proportionally. This field is optional.'}, 'scale_width': {'description': 'scale_width 单位为 px，范围 [0, 4320]，仅在 scale_type=2 时生效；只传宽或高之一时另一边按比例缩放。', 'maximum': 4320, 'minimum': 0, 'type': 'integer', 'x-description-en': 'The target width of the video, in px, with a value range of [0, 4320]. It takes effect only when scale_type is set to 2 (width/height limit mode). If only one of scale_width or scale_height is provided, the other side scales proportionally. This field is optional.'}}, 'required': ['codec', 'bitrate_mode', 'bitrate_kbps'], 'type': 'object', 'x-description-en': 'Video transcoding parameter configuration. This parameter is required.'})] = Field(...),
